(7423057, 1171544, 59029, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...a lit candle, a pair of eggs, die of varying sizes showing mostly snake eyes, a statue of an angry-looking swine, what looks like a cow skull (though maybe it''s a pig skull?) a clove of garlic, the opposing knights from chess, and a small glass flask.<br/> <br/>So I''m hazarding that your message is something like: Life can be snuffed as easily as a lit candle.  I have garlic so evil spirits and such can''t attack me. The knights are good and evil, so they rule each other out.  The skull, this is how we will all end up.  The swine statue...pig out on life while you can.  And the die?  Take a gamble.  And the empty flask?  Drink up, for life is short.<br/> <br/>And that''s what I have to say about it! 7</td>', 'Hmmm...a lit candle, a pair of eggs, die of varying sizes showing mostly snake eyes, a statue of an angry-looking swine, what looks like a cow skull (though maybe it''s a pig skull?) a clove of garlic, the opposing knights from chess, and a small glass flask. So I''m hazarding that your message is something like: Life can be snuffed as easily as a lit candle.  I have garlic so evil spirits and such can''t attack me. The knights are good and evil, so they rule each other out.  The skull, this is how we will all end up.  The swine statue...pig out on life while you can.  And the die?  Take a gamble.  And the empty flask?  Drink up, for life is short. And that''s what I have to say about it! 7', '2015-12-18 18:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7423058, 1171636, 59029, '<td valign="top">Hmm a dead ivy (or one that has lost its leaves for the season) climbing a building that seems to be in a desolate industrial park.  Interesting.  Nice tones. 7</td>', 'Hmm a dead ivy (or one that has lost its leaves for the season) climbing a building that seems to be in a desolate industrial park.  Interesting.  Nice tones. 7', '2015-12-18 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7423059, 1171754, 59029, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract, the female form is definitely there.  Good work. 7</td>', 'Cool abstract, the female form is definitely there.  Good work. 7', '2015-12-18 18:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7423060, 1171698, 59029, '<td valign="top">Ok so life is a race and you can either be the slow, methodical tortoise or the fast impetuous hare.  Got it.  Next! :-) 7</td>', 'Ok so life is a race and you can either be the slow, methodical tortoise or the fast impetuous hare.  Got it.  Next! :-) 7', '2015-12-18 18:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
